conversation-id: conv-{jid}-guid-{uuid};

|SensorAgent|
note right
  <b>Agente Reativo</b>
  ReceiveSensorDataBehaviour
  Guard: [performative == REQUEST]
end note
:Receber MSG ACL
REQUEST / movement_recommendation;
if (performative == REQUEST?) then (sim)
else (nao)
  :Ignorar mensagem;
  stop
endif
